    "narrative": "The Austin Waves lineup today is anchored by **Gunnar Henderson** (73.99) and **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (66.90), who stand as our clear elite plays. **Gunnar Henderson** benefits from a high-upside matchup against Jos\u00e9 Soriano; while his score reflects a slight discount for the opposing catcher\u2019s elite pop time and the pitcher\u2019s ability to hold runners, his second-hole placement and platoon advantage make him the pivot point for our production. Meanwhile, **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** enters a favorable environment against Mike Burrows, with an xERA of 4.31 providing enough cushion to offset a slight negative platoon adjustment, keeping his ceiling safely in the \"Strong\" territory.\n\nOur most aggressive deployment today is **Nolan Schanuel** (62.46), who leverages a significant +19% boost from facing Trey Gibson\u2019s 5.27 xERA. While **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (61.13) occupies a lower lineup spot, his strong BvP history and dynamic platoon edge against Aaron Nola keep him in the starting mix. On the bench, **Brayan Rocchio** (56.38) provided the stiffest competition for a starting spot; he ultimately missed the cut due to an unfavorable 32% rain risk and a lower baseline projection compared to the versatility of **Jacob Wilson** (57.23). **Jacob Wilson** gets the nod primarily due to the wind blowing out, providing a marginal power ceiling that **Brayan Rocchio** lacks.\n\nThe day carries moderate volatility, specifically regarding weather and personnel. Both **Sam Antonacci** and our bench option **Miguel Vargas** face a 32% rain risk in their matchup against Tanner Bibee, an outcome that could force late-game adjustments. Furthermore, while we have projected lineups for **Drake Baldwin**, **Nolan Schanuel**, and **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**, these remain \"Lineup Pending.\" Should any of these players move down the order or receive a surprise day off, we are prepared to pivot to the bench, where **Nasim Nunez** and **Dominic Smith** are waiting to preserve our efficiency floor if the current matchups sour.",
